{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18105512","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18105512","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1810551201:0":{"text":"これでよし……ヒルダ、もう体は痛まないだろう？さあ、力を抜いて……","source_cn":"这样便好了。希尔达，你身上已经不疼了，放松些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71B3F60F481C867E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810551202:0":{"text":"ヒルダはまだ荒く息をしている。魂と体がうまく馴染んでいないのか、どうにも反応が鈍いところがあるようだ。","source_cn":"“希尔达”仍然喘着粗气。不知是不是因为灵魂与躯体的不匹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D6673BD638E25E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810551203:0":{"text":"ヒルダを落ち着かせようと、ムン婆はまたあの歌を口ずさんだ。それから左手を伸ばし、彼女の左肩――あの枝を肩と呼べるなら――に手を置き、ゆっくりリズムを刻むように叩いた。","source_cn":"仿佛想要安抚她一样，穆婆婆再次哼起那首歌谣，又伸出左手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58DCFBD70681073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810551204:0":{"text":"柔らかな鼻歌の響きの中で、あなたはセインとレナードが、いつの間にか同じようにムン婆の手を見つめていることに気づいた。","source_cn":"温柔哼唱声里，你注意到了瑟恩和里纳的视线。它们不约而同...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02E3546CAF35D959","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"柔らかな鼻歌の響きの中で、あなたはセインとレナードが、いつの間にか同じようにムン婆の手を見つめていることに気づいた。","female":"柔らかな鼻歌の響きの中で、あなたはセインとレナードが、いつの間にか同じようにムン婆の手を見つめていることに気づいた。","variant_male_record_index":"242204","variant_female_record_index":"242205","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810551205:0":{"text":"ばあちゃんは誰かをなだめるとき、いつも左手で相手の左肩をポンポン叩くんだ。前から、それがなんだか妙に懐かしくてさ……","source_cn":"婆婆安慰人的时候，总是喜欢用左手拍别人的左肩……我一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1622A9C2318117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810551206:0":{"text":"目覚めたばかりで何も分からなかった頃、ばあちゃんに肩を叩いてもらうと、心が落ち着いてすごく安心したのを覚えてるんだけど――","source_cn":"哪怕是刚刚醒来，什么都不知道的时候，只要婆婆这样拍拍我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA92B0E761531D5CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810551207:0":{"text":"それも、バヤチェ先生の影響なのかな？","source_cn":"这也是因为巴亚茄先生吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF04634CA1F397D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810551208:0":{"text":"ああ。私たちが島を訪れたのは、まだ若かった頃だ。当時……悪い知らせが届いてな、先生はそうやって慰めてくれたんだ。","source_cn":"嗯，我们去幽声群岛的时候还很年轻，当时收到了……一些不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA907BAB102F513","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810551209:0":{"text":"…………","source_cn":"…………<key:dialog80>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9431C920207A02AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810551210:1":{"text":"……あんたとセリスの言うことは本当なのかもな。でも、俺はいつになったら過去を思い出せるんだろう……","source_cn":"……我开始有些相信你和爱丝说的话了。但我不知道什么时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46520EDBA387854","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810551211:0":{"text":"大丈夫よ。こうして会えたんだから、ゆっくり思い出していきましょう。","source_cn":"没关系，我们已经找到你了，慢慢来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1D3DE6254C1D76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810551212:1":{"text":"ああ。時間はたっぷりある。","source_cn":"嗯，我们还有很长的时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE30C8B5F3E589B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1810551213:0":{"text":"奇妙な歌声の中、満月は徐々に形を変えていった……","source_cn":"在奇特的歌声之中，圆月渐渐变化……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C18DD85D066C225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1810551214:0":{"text":"そして月が消える前に、ようやくヒルダの力が回復した。","source_cn":"赶在满月消失前，“希尔达”终于恢复了力量","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62247E1169DE14B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:穆婆婆":{"text":"ムン","source":"穆婆婆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialog